  "theoryHtml": "<div class=\"section-header\">\n  <div>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\"><span>📖</span> Apunts: Decimals, unitats i geometria</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Teoria de 5è amb targetes, taules i exemples bé / mal — potències de 10, arrodoniment, sistema mètric, polígons, decimals i pla cartesià.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== VALOR POSICIONAL ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>🔢</span> 0. Valor posicional (enters i decimals)</h3>\n  <p class=\"du-lead\">Cada xifra val segons el lloc. A l'esquerra de la coma: unitats, desenes… A la dreta: dècimes, centèsimes… Un lloc = ×10 o ÷10.</p>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Centenes</th>\n          <th>Desenes</th>\n          <th>Unitats</th>\n          <th class=\"du-comma\">,</th>\n          <th>Dècimes</th>\n          <th>Centèsimes</th>\n          <th>Mil·lèsimes</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>3</td>\n          <td>1</td>\n          <td>4</td>\n          <td class=\"du-comma\">,</td>\n          <td class=\"du-hl\">1</td>\n          <td>5</td>\n          <td>9</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"du-note\">A <strong>314,159</strong> el <strong>1</strong> després de la coma són les dècimes (1/10). Truc: puntets cada 3 xifres als enters; la coma és la frontera dels decimals.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== GRID DE TARGETES ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-cards-grid\">\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#0f766e;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f766e;\"><span>🔟</span> 1. Potències de 10</h3>\n    <p>Multiplicar o dividir per 10, 100, 1000… = <strong>desplaçar la coma</strong> sense recalcular tot.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>× 10ⁿ:</strong> coma <em>n</em> llocs a la <strong>dreta</strong> (+ zeros si cal).</li>\n      <li><strong>÷ 10ⁿ:</strong> coma <em>n</em> llocs a l'<strong>esquerra</strong> (+ zeros davant si cal).</li>\n      <li><strong>Truc:</strong> els zeros de 10/100/1000 = quants salts.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#0284c7;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0284c7;\"><span>🎯</span> 2. Arrodoniment</h3>\n    <p>Aproxima a desena, centena, miler o enter. Mira el dígit de la dreta:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>0–4</strong> → mantens · <strong>5–9</strong> → puges 1.</li>\n      <li>La resta d'ordres menors passen a zero.</li>\n      <li>Per diners: arrodoneix <em>amunt</em> per assegurar marge.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#d97706;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#d97706;\"><span>📏</span> 3. Sistema mètric</h3>\n    <p>Longitud (m), massa (g) i capacitat (l) comparteixen prefixos. Cada graó = ×10 o ÷10.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Baixar</strong> (unitat més petita) → multiplica.</li>\n      <li><strong>Pujar</strong> (unitat més gran) → divideix.</li>\n      <li><strong>1 km = 1.000 m</strong> (com a Posa't a prova).</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#8b5cf6;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#8b5cf6;\"><span>⬡</span> 4. Polígons i trapezi</h3>\n    <p><strong>Perímetre</strong> = suma de tots els costats (la tanca). Diagonals: D = n(n−3)/2.</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Quadrilàter → <strong>2</strong> diagonals.</li>\n      <li><strong>Trapezi:</strong> 1 parell de costats paral·lels (no és paral·lelogram).</li>\n      <li>Convex: diagonals a dins; angles &lt; 180°.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#e11d48;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#e11d48;\"><span>✖️</span> 5. Decimal × natural</h3>\n    <p>Algoritme en 3 passos:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>1) Multiplica com enters (ignora la coma).</li>\n      <li>2) Compte els decimals del factor.</li>\n      <li>3) Posiciona la coma des de la dreta.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#ec4899;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#ec4899;\"><span>➗</span> 6. Divisió i residu</h3>\n    <p><strong>Prova:</strong> D = d × q + r (sempre r &lt; d).</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Residu 0 → decimal exacte.</li>\n      <li>Residu cíclic → periòdic (106÷3 = 35,333…).</li>\n      <li>El context decideix: enter, decimal o «R».</li>\n    </ul>\n  </article>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== TAULA POTÈNCIES ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>🔟</span> Exemples: moure la coma</h3>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table du-table-striped\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Operació</th>\n          <th>Salts</th>\n          <th>Resultat</th>\n          <th>Nota</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>0,975 × 10</td><td>1 a la dreta</td><td><strong>9,75</strong></td><td>Multiplicar</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>12,3 × 100</td><td>2 a la dreta</td><td><strong>1230</strong></td><td>Cal un zero</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>3,14 × 1000</td><td>3 a la dreta</td><td><strong>3140</strong></td><td>Cal un zero</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>0,76 ÷ 10</td><td>1 a l'esquerra</td><td><strong>0,076</strong></td><td>Zero auxiliar</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>423 ÷ 100</td><td>2 a l'esquerra</td><td><strong>4,23</strong></td><td>Coma implícita</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>36,143 ÷ 1000</td><td>3 a l'esquerra</td><td><strong>0,036143</strong></td><td>Zero davant</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"du-split\">\n    <div class=\"du-ok\">\n      <strong>✅ Bé</strong>\n      <p>Compte els zeros → salta la coma. Enters: truc dels ceros (400×30 = 12.000).</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"du-bad\">\n      <strong>❌ Mal</strong>\n      <p>Afegir zeros a ull o moure la coma a l'esquerra quan multipliques.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== TAULA ARRODONIMENT ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>🎯</span> Exemples d'arrodoniment</h3>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table du-table-striped\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Nombre</th>\n          <th>A …</th>\n          <th>Dígit clau</th>\n          <th>Resultat</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>745</td><td>desena</td><td>5 (≥5)</td><td><strong>750</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2561</td><td>desena</td><td>1 (&lt;5)</td><td><strong>2560</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>1255</td><td>centena</td><td>5</td><td><strong>1300</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>1500</td><td>miler</td><td>5</td><td><strong>2000</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>3205</td><td>miler</td><td>2 (&lt;5)</td><td><strong>3000</strong> <em>(no 3200)</em></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>5050</td><td>miler</td><td>0</td><td><strong>5000</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>14,5</td><td>enter</td><td>5</td><td><strong>15</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>16,09</td><td>enter</td><td>0</td><td><strong>16</strong></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"du-note\"><strong>Problema diners:</strong> 4 × 8,48 € amb 40 € → arrodoneix a 9 € → 4×9 = 36 &lt; 40 → n'hi ha prou.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== TAULA MÈTRICA ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>📏</span> Escalera mètrica</h3>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>km / kg / kl</th>\n          <th>hm / hg / hl</th>\n          <th>dam / dag / dal</th>\n          <th class=\"du-hl\">m / g / l</th>\n          <th>dm / dg / dl</th>\n          <th>cm / cg / cl</th>\n          <th>mm / mg / ml</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>×1000</td>\n          <td>×100</td>\n          <td>×10</td>\n          <td class=\"du-hl\"><strong>base</strong></td>\n          <td>×0,1</td>\n          <td>×0,01</td>\n          <td>×0,001</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\" style=\"margin-top:0.85rem;\">\n    <table class=\"du-table du-table-striped\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Conversió</th><th>Graons</th><th>Operació</th><th>Resultat</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>14 m → cm</td><td>2 avall</td><td>×100</td><td><strong>1400 cm</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>17,241 km → m</td><td>3 avall</td><td>×1000</td><td><strong>17241 m</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>1796 m → km</td><td>3 amunt</td><td>÷1000</td><td><strong>1,796 km</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>4000 g → kg</td><td>3 amunt</td><td>÷1000</td><td><strong>4 kg</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>1000 ml → dl</td><td>2 amunt</td><td>÷100</td><td><strong>10 dl</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>96 km → m</td><td>3 avall</td><td>×1000</td><td><strong>96000 m</strong></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"du-note\">Per <strong>ordenar</strong> magnituds barrejades: passa-ho tot a la mateixa unitat (m o l) i després compara.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== DECIMAL × NATURAL + POLÍGONS ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-cards-grid\">\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#059669;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#059669;\"><span>✖️</span> Decimal × natural — exemples</h3>\n    <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"du-table du-table-compact\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Càlcul</th><th>Sense coma</th><th>Decimals</th><th>Final</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>2,4 × 5</td><td>24×5=120</td><td>1</td><td><strong>12</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>173 × 1,2</td><td>173×12=2076</td><td>1</td><td><strong>207,6</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>173 × 0,12</td><td>173×12=2076</td><td>2</td><td><strong>20,76</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>12 × 8,1</td><td>12×81=972</td><td>1</td><td><strong>97,2</strong></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"du-note\" style=\"margin-top:0.65rem;\">Llitó: 1,45×4 = 5,80 m &gt; 5 m → <strong>falten 0,80 m</strong>.</p>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#7c3aed;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed;\"><span>⬡</span> Trapezi de l'examen</h3>\n    <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"du-table du-table-compact\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Pregunta</th><th>Resposta</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Vèrtexs / costats</td><td><strong>4 / 4</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Diagonals</td><td><strong>2</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Perímetre 9+6+6+6</td><td><strong>27 cm</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Costats paral·lels</td><td><strong>1 parell</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Paral·lelogram?</td><td><strong>No</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Còncau / convex</td><td><strong>Convex</strong></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== DIVISIÓ CONTEXTOS ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>➗</span> 34 ÷ 5: el mateix càlcul, 5 respostes</h3>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table du-table-striped\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Context</th><th>Tipus</th><th>Resposta</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Persones en cotxes de 5 places</td><td>Discret (amunt)</td><td><strong>7 cotxes</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>34 m de tela, 5 m/vestit</td><td>Truncament</td><td><strong>6 vestits</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>34 € entre 5 comensals</td><td>Diners</td><td><strong>6,80 €</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>34 ampolles, 5/dia</td><td>Quocient + residu</td><td><strong>6 R 4</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td>34 barres entre 5 (es parten)</td><td>Fracció</td><td><strong>6 4/5</strong></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"du-split\">\n    <div class=\"du-ok\">\n      <strong>✅ Exacte</strong>\n      <p>36÷5 = 7,2 · 10÷4 = 2,5 · 64÷5 = 12,8 (residu arriba a 0).</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"du-bad\">\n      <strong>⚠️ Periòdic</strong>\n      <p>106÷3 = 35,333… perquè 3 no és factor 2 ni 5.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== CARTESIÀ + DAUS ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-cards-grid\">\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#0369a1;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0369a1;\"><span>🗺️</span> Pla cartesià (x, y)</h3>\n    <p>Conveni escolar: <strong>(Carrer, Avinguda)</strong>. L'ordre és estricte.</p>\n    <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"du-table du-table-compact\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Descripció</th><th>Punt</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Carrer 4, 3a Av.</td><td><strong>(4, 3)</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>«2 amb 8a»</td><td><strong>(2, 8)</strong></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Confondre (1,5) amb (5,1)</td><td>Punt equivocat</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"du-note\">No és el mapa geogràfic del Projecte de Medi (latitud/longitud).</p>\n  </article>\n\n  <article class=\"du-card\" style=\"border-top-color:#ca8a04;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#ca8a04;\"><span>🎲</span> Daus: producte màxim</h3>\n    <p>Dígits 1, 3, 6, 9. Millor repartir dígits alts amb multiplicador &gt; 1.</p>\n    <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"du-table du-table-compact\">\n        <thead><tr><th>Jugador</th><th>Operació</th><th>Producte</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>Claudi</td><td>91 × 6,3</td><td><strong>573,3</strong> ✅</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>Eulàlia</td><td>631 × 0,9</td><td>567,9</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ========== RESUM ========== -->\n<div class=\"du-theory-block du-summary\">\n  <h3 class=\"du-block-title\"><span>⏱️</span> Resum en 1 minut</h3>\n  <div class=\"du-table-wrap\">\n    <table class=\"du-table\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td><strong>🔟 Coma</strong></td><td>Dreta = ×10ⁿ · Esquerra = ÷10ⁿ (compte els zeros)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>🎯 Arrodonir</strong></td><td>≥5 puja · &lt;5 mantén (1500→2000 · 3205→3000)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>📏 Mètric</strong></td><td>1 km = 1.000 m · cada graó ×/÷10</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>🧱 Perímetre</strong></td><td>Suma de costats · trapezi ≠ paral·lelogram</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>➗ Prova</strong></td><td>D = d×q+r · el context tria enter o decimal</td></tr>\n        <tr><td><strong>🗺️ (x,y)</strong></td><td>Ordre estricte: primer carrer, després avinguda</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
